  "sports_holdings_caveat": "The `sports_holdings` sector is a real category for a sponsorship product -- multi-club groups DO buy inventory -- but it is also where the org layer folds back on itself: Manchester United Limited and NEEP Roma Holding are the clubs' own holding entities appearing as their own 'company' via an owner edge. Any brand-exposure claim should EXCLUDE sports_holdings, because a club owning itself is not sponsorship. It is retained rather than deleted so the exclusion is visible and reversible."
